      "type": "toggle",
      "label": "Vectors shown",
      "options": ["F (vector field)", "curl F + n dS"],
      "default": "F (vector field)",
      "teaches": "Stokes' theorem integrates curl F dotted with the surface normal, not the flux of F itself — the curl field points in a different direction than F and is what pairs with dS"
